# Half of the wizard's pair. GMS runs it over 20 levels at 99+5x; here it is
# the same climb in half the steps, ending where GMS ends.
#
# The cooldown is not a cost. It is barely half a swing, so the other half of
# the pair is always ready to fill it -- which is what makes the two alternate
# rather than the better one being cast forever. See fight.h.
name: "Cold Beam"
skill_order: 1
description: "An ice-attribute attack. Grow sharp ice crystals in front of you."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_WIZARD
max_level: 10
base_delay_ms: 810
max_enemies: 6
lines: 3
cooldown_seconds: 0.5
base { skill_pct: 1.09 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
